    "| **Training time** | Hours (one-time) | Days (iterative) |\n",
    "| **Inference** | Milliseconds | Evolves design iteratively |\n",
    "| **Generalization** | Within training dist. | Adapts to new objectives |\n",
    "| **Examples** | Chapters 2-3 | Chapters 4-5 |\n",
    "\n",
